    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1731059650308\" id=\"item-672dda0498f9e244465267bf\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-e7e0b7bf94631d30e5d7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:</strong> Property Media Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans, and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key features include:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Four Bedrooms</strong>: Each room provides generous space, natural light, and a peaceful atmosphere, perfect for relaxation.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Stylish Bathrooms</strong>: Equipped with modern fixtures, designed for comfort and convenience.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Spacious Living Room</strong>: Flows effortlessly to the dining and kitchen areas, creating a welcoming space for gatherings.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage</strong>: Offers secure parking and additional storage options.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Space</strong>: A private backyard awaits, ideal for outdoor dining, play, or simply unwinding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">With easy access to local amenities, schools, parks, and transport options, 17 Wisteria Lane in Millwater is an ideal choice for those seeking a family-friendly lifestyle in a vibrant community.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;672ddd1fdb431b2e12494949&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;672ddd1fdb431b2e12494949&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730782483469_583416\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"672ddd463e56291912cb58e6\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1731059023079-NX2DDLUIOTBUXIG4QFJJ/17+Wisteria+Lane%2C+Millwater+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%288%29.jpg\" alt=\"17 Wisteria Lane, Millwater Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (8).jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-stacked\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1731059023079-NX2DDLUIOTBUXIG4QFJJ/17+Wisteria+Lane%2C+Millwater+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Pr